<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#333333" line-height="24px" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="20px" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#7E317B"
        color="#ffffff"
        font-weight="bold"
        border-radius="4px"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .header-text {
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .exec-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }
      .exec-table td {
        padding: 8px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .role-name {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #7e317b;
        width: 40%;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f4f4f4">
    <mj-section background-color="#7E317B" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="300px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcCrest.png"
          alt="DUMC Crest"
        />
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="28px"
          font-weight="900"
          css-class="header-text"
        >
          WAD WEEKLY
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Apologies for the later one this week, but hey it's not called WAD every Tuesday is it? We've had a wholly successful week of taster sessions, socials, and comps, so let's dive right in!
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-bottom="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#7E317B"
          >📅 COMING UP</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#7E317B" />
        <mj-text>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Mon 7:30pm:</strong> Anything but a Chalk Bag (DCC + The Water
              House)
            </li>
            <li><strong>Fri 5:00pm:</strong> <a src="https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddo0eM6hva3/?obrf=MXAyZWt3bm5wenlnYg==">Spooky Sends</a> (DCC)</li>
            <li><strong>Thu 6:30pm:</strong> Team Training (DCC)</li>
          </ul>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="0px">
      <mj-column
        border="2px solid #7E317B"
        background-color="#fdf7fd"
        border-radius="8px"
        padding="10px"
      >
        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold" color="#7E317B"
          >📋 Team Durham Membership</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          All members who have filled out our membership form must also complete the Team Durham membership form below. Apologies for the inconvenience, for any new members this will be linked at the end of our form.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center">
          <a
            href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/e/paeZbjPmNe"
            style="
              color: #7e317b;
              text-decoration: underline;
              font-weight: bold;
            "
            >Team Durham Membership Form</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#fafafa">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="22px" font-weight="bold" color="#7E317B"
          >🧗 LAST WEEK IN THE DUMC</mj-text
        >
        <mj-divider border-width="2px" border-color="#7E317B" />

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >NUBS Round 1</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          A group of keen comp kids visited Leeds last Wednesday for NUBS round 1. Good scores all round - as a team Durham came 8th so well done everyone! Special shout out to Chiara for an amazing performance to come 9th.</br>
          <strong>- Alasdair</strong>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Roped-up Social</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          Last Wednesday we engaged in our annual roped-up social to welcome new members into the club. A good time was had by all, despite some entanglements in queues at certain college bars. We had great turn out, so thank you to everyone who made it!
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Freshers Meet</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          Last Sunday saw 5 cars full of keen climbers head up to Back Bowden. Both trad and bouldering were done aplenty, with lots of people trying both. Congratulations are due to Ethan for his first 7b boulder. Thanks to Jim for organising.</br>
          <strong>- Alasdair</strong>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold"
          >Taster Sessions and the first Beer & Boulder of Term</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text>
          We wrapped up the last of our taster sessions last Sunday after incredible numbers of new climbers! I was so pleased to see many first-time climbers and many returning to the sport. A special thank you to our Boulder Captain Ethan for organising them!</br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Returning to our usual routine, we also saw one of the strongest Beer & Boulder turnouts (at least of my time) on Monday. As a reminder, we return to our usual routine of Beer & Boulder Mondays 7:30pm, and Team Training on Thursdays 8:00pm, both at the DCC and no need to book! I hope many of you stick around, and if you're interested in becoming a member look for the sign-up details on any of our chats, Instagram, or Facebook.
        </mj-text>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="40px">
      <mj-column border="2px dashed #7E317B" border-radius="10px">
        <mj-text
          align="center"
          font-size="20px"
          font-weight="bold"
          color="#7E317B"
          >💪 WAD OF THE WEEK</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text align="center" font-style="italic">
          Chiara for her outstanding performance at NUBS R1 to place 9th!
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding-top="20px" padding-bottom="40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Harry Richards</strong><br />
          DUMC President
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#222222" padding="40px 20px">
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-image
          width="120px"
          src="https://harryrich02.github.io/DUMC/img/dumcLogo.png"
          alt="DUMC Logo"
        />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column vertical-align="middle">
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="14px"
          align="center"
          padding-bottom="10px"
        >
          <strong>Durham University Mountaineering Club</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-social font-size="15px" icon-size="30px" mode="horizontal">
          <mj-social-element
            name="instagram"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/du.mountaineering"
            background-color="#7E317B"
          ></mj-social-element>
          <mj-social-element
            name="facebook"
            href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/DUMC.Forum"
            background-color="#7E317B"
          ></mj-social-element>
        </mj-social>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" padding-top="15px">
          <a
            href="https://mountaineeringclub.webspace.durham.ac.uk/"
            style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline"
            >Visit our Website</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
